# api http test requests for VSCode

### get cats
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats


### get cat by id
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats/3


### post new cat
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nisha",
  "age": 2,
  "birthdate": "2021-01-01",
  "breed": "Domestic Shorthair",
  "weight": 4.5,
  "color": "gray",
  "gender": "Male",
  "vaccinated": true,
  "neutered": true,
  "microchipped": true,
  "owner": "Michael Jackson",
  "image": "https://placecats.com/300/200"
}
